{
  "$comment": "Freeband v3 design tokens (docs/design-v3-spec.md section 2). This file is the single source: edit it, then run `python3 -I scripts/gen_tokens.py` to regenerate ios/Freeband/UI/Design/Tokens.generated.swift and hub/src/views/tokens.ts. Colours: every entry has light and dark; lightContrast/darkContrast are the Increase Contrast (prefers-contrast: more) values and default to the base value. {\"ref\": name} aliases another colour, contrast variants included.",
  "version": 3,
  "color": {
    "canvas": { "dark": "#0E0F12", "light": "#FFFFFF", "note": "screen background" },
